refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.description;
arraysodium_crypto_kx_server_session_keys #[\SensitiveParameter]stringserver_key_pair stringclient_key
Calculate the server-side session keys, using the X25519 + BLAKE2b key-exchange method.

&reftitle.errors;
If server_key_pair is not exactly SODIUM_CRYPTO_KX_KEYPAIRBYTES (64) bytes long, a SodiumException will be thrown.
If client_key is not exactly SODIUM_CRYPTO_KX_PUBLICKEYBYTES (32) bytes long, a SodiumException will be thrown.
